[OK] Connected to MongoDB at mongodb://localhost:27017
[OK] Dropped collection: chapter_06.products_perf
=== Step 1: Insert 10,000 products, no indexes except _id ===
  0 secondary indexes: 10,000 inserts, median of 5 runs = 0.085s (117,777 docs/sec; range 0.079-0.110s)

=== Step 2: Create 5 indexes, insert another 10,000 ===
  idx_category_price_rating    keys={'category': 1, 'price': 1, 'rating': 1}  -> Q1 (prefix), Q5 (ESR)
  idx_price                    keys={'price': 1}  -> Q2
  idx_tags                     keys={'tags': 1}  -> Q3 (multikey)
  idx_name_text                keys={'name': 'text'}  -> Q4
  idx_stock                    keys={'stock': 1}  -> none of Q1-Q5
  5 secondary indexes: 10,000 inserts, median of 5 runs = 0.335s (29,831 docs/sec; range 0.312-0.376s)

  Percentage slowdown with 5 indexes: +294.8%

=== Step 3: Five queries with all 5 indexes (20,000 docs, avg of 20 runs) ===
  Q1 Electronics, cheapest 20 first   LIMIT > FETCH > IXSCAN       docs=    20  avg=  0.69 ms
  Q2 Price between $100 and $150      FETCH > IXSCAN               docs=   993  avg=  6.06 ms
  Q3 Tagged 'wireless'                FETCH > IXSCAN               docs= 4,184  avg= 20.87 ms
  Q4 Text search name: 'headphones'   TEXT_MATCH > FETCH > IXSCAN  docs=   478  avg=  4.69 ms
  Q5 Books rated >= 4.5, by price     FETCH > IXSCAN               docs=   347  avg= 10.15 ms

=== Step 3: Drop all but the most critical index ===
  Keeping idx_category_price_rating: most used in Activity 6.1's $indexStats (activity_6_1_try_it_yourself_index_stats.json).
  Dropped idx_price
  Dropped idx_tags
  Dropped idx_name_text
  Dropped idx_stock
  Remaining: ['_id_', 'idx_category_price_rating']

=== Step 3: Five queries with only idx_category_price_rating ===
  Q1 Electronics, cheapest 20 first   LIMIT > FETCH > IXSCAN       docs=    20  avg=  0.93 ms
  Q2 Price between $100 and $150      COLLSCAN                     docs=20,000  avg= 12.78 ms
  Q3 Tagged 'wireless'                COLLSCAN                     docs=20,000  avg= 20.16 ms
  Q4 Text search name: 'headphones'   COLLSCAN                     docs=20,000  avg= 15.25 ms  [regex fallback]
  Q5 Books rated >= 4.5, by price     FETCH > IXSCAN               docs=   347  avg=  7.36 ms

